#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains what the system is designed to optimise for, and the relevance of the different parameters
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of the expected output and output quality of the system
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the decisions about any possible trade-off made regarding the technical solutions adopted to comply with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of the system architecture explaining how software components build on or feed into each other and integrate into the overall processing
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the computational resources used to develop, train, test and validate the AI system
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains where relevant, the data requirements in terms of datasheets describing the training methodologies and techniques and the training data sets used, including a general description of these data sets, information about their provenance, scope and main characteristics; how the data was obtained and selected; labelling procedures (e.g. for supervised learning), data cleaning methodologies (e.g. outliers detection)
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
