#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 2, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
